          "heading": "How we started",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> Some of us came from math departments. Some of us came from being annoyed that a star would not repeat. {{guild_name}} is the overlap: cloth that tiles, and a room that will say so when it does not.</p>",
