          "id": "p-body",
          "variant": "prose",
          "heading": "Close it",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> If the edges do not meet when you wrap the plane, it is a motif, not a tessellation. Motifs are allowed at other guilds. Here we close it, or we call it a study and put it in a notebook.</p>",
